# All checkpoints (~5 MB) and all datasets -- including the full 866 MB
# data/raw/args_me_corpus/args-me.jsonl -- are tracked on purpose.
# Note: GitHub rejects files over 100 MB on a plain push; if you host this on
# GitHub, either use Git LFS (git lfs track "data/raw/args_me_corpus/args-me.jsonl")
# or push to a host without that limit. The file itself is kept as-is here.
